<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin 273-day T-bill average yield 9.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin 273-day T-bill average yield 9.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at an auction of Slovak Finance Ministry 273-day treasury bills hit 9.669 percent, up from 9.307 percent in the last auction of similar bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					  Nov 6	  Oct 30</p>
<p> Bids (billion crowns)	    2.717	  5.220</p>
<p> Bids accepted			2.717	  3.570</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		9.390	  9.200</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		9.669	  9.307</p>
<p> Maximum yield (pct)	     10.000	  9.400</p>
<p> Maturity date		  Aug 7, 1997    July 31, 1997</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
